title: "Rental Income: Why Lenders Count 50% vs. 80% of Your Rent"
description: "Lenders don't count all of your rental income when you qualify. Whether they use 50% or 80%, and how, can change how much you can borrow."
publishDate: 2026-11-18
category: investment
readTime: 5
